    "detailed_description": "<h1>You might also like:</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>It is the Age of the Vikings.<br>An age of glory, conquest, and unbridled desire.<br><br>So grab your axe, board your longship, and take a swig of mead from your drinking horn as you dive into <strong>Vikings: Sex and Blood</strong>.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/bdefdfc138af8c80f0e44451efe132a3.poster.avif?t=1753866315\" width=620 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/bdefdfc138af8c80f0e44451efe132a3.webm?t=1753866315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/bdefdfc138af8c80f0e44451efe132a3.mp4?t=1753866315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><br>You will play as a Viking warrior shipwrecked on a backwards, undeveloped village of Krokr. A campaign will see you rise to a position of influence within the village, protecting it from invaders and launching raids on other settlements.<br><br>Explore the icy islands of the North.<br>Harvest the raw materials you need to strengthen your warriors or construct new buildings in your village.<br>Craft weapons and armour by gathering different resources or raiding other villages and steal their resources.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/a676e40ff716a48720b534564490b1c7.poster.avif?t=1753866315\" width=620 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/a676e40ff716a48720b534564490b1c7.webm?t=1753866315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/a676e40ff716a48720b534564490b1c7.mp4?t=1753866315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Embark on quests for women in the village and you will gradually gain their loyalty. Their trust in you will be rewarded with <strong>high-quality</strong> animated sex scenes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/68cb545255b0de1f20e188a40efd4be0.poster.avif?t=1753866315\" width=620 height=198 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/68cb545255b0de1f20e188a40efd4be0.webm?t=1753866315\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2774580/extras/68cb545255b0de1f20e188a40efd4be0.mp4?t=1753866315\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>As your power and influence grows, so too will your harem! With 7 women already in the game and  more planned, <strong>Vikings: Sex and Blood</strong> will keep you coming back again and again!<br><br>There are already over 2000 high-quality renders and 100+ animations with more in production as development continues!",
